  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ea56b8c7a755349868431d684f0967fc, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  note: "These Prefabs contain some simple objects and effects to demonstrate how
    event channels work.\n\nThe Broadcaster notifies the event channel. The event
    channel notifies the Listeners. Try connecting and disconnecting the Broadcaster
    and Listeners from the event channel to understand how they work. \n\nThis decoupling
    pattern allows you to make changes to the Broadcaster without impacting the Listeners
    and vice versa.\n"
